      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Alcohol use among high schoolers is falling fast.  \n\nThere\u2019s a massive opportunity here for Beer &amp; alcohol companies to pivot.  \n\nTheir future customers are less and less interested in their product.",
